# device_gap_barrier_timeout_report_mismatch_dies: The report a barrier posts by itself: child 1 (stamp index 2) blocks on 5:1, which nothing signals; child 2 has stamp index 5. After 2 s the wait times out and posts the stamp-wait report, whose walk looks stamp index 2 up, finds child 2 in the device's child FIFO slot 2 with stamp index 5, and asserts. No register write asks for it: the host dies inside a 4 s wait on child 1's stamp, which is the op the outcome names (docs/testing.md 7.4, which had this path read but not locked).
